('anki-card-1758690636730-47', 'anki-deck-1758689429896-1790185671252', 'If the body is lacking an essential amino acid (EAA), what will be the course of action? *', 'Protein synthesis will be limited.', '', '["Protein synthesis will be limited.","Health will not be affected as long as other nutrients are adequate.","Proteins will be made but they will lack that particular EAA.","Body cells will synthesize the EAA."]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-29T11:38:00.332Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-09-28T11:38:00.332Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-23T17:47:52.013Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-28T11:38:00.332Z"'::jsonb),
