('anki-card-1758690476587-38', 'anki-deck-1758689429896-1790185671252', 'It has been known that Vitamin A improves eyesight. This statement, however, is not completely true. What makes this claim about vitamin A partly false? *', 'Rhodopsin is only used to see in the dark but not when enough light is available.', '', '["None of these explanations makes the statement about vitamin A partly false.","Rhodopsin is only used to see in the dark but not when enough light is available.","Vitamin A is not only good for eyesight but is also good for the skin.","It is actually vitamin E that functions for the improvement of eyesight."]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-29T11:48:30.570Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-09-28T11:48:30.570Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-23T17:47:52.013Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-28T11:48:30.570Z"'::jsonb),
