('anki-card-1758691595086-95', 'anki-deck-1758689429896-1790185671252', 'Vitamin C is the most unstable of all water-soluble vitamins. On the other hand, vitamin B3 is the most stable. *', 'Both statements are correct.', '', '["Both statements are incorrect","Only the first statement is correct.","Only the second statement is correct.","Both statements are correct."]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-29T10:31:11.204Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-09-28T10:31:11.204Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-23T17:47:52.013Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-28T10:31:11.204Z"'::jsonb),
