('anki-card-1758603703040-34', 'anki-deck-1783610421391-1790433139851-sw8ch', 'Dietary management for people with delayed gastric emptying most often includes:*', 'Low fiber, low fat foods given in frequent small meals.', '', '["Low fiber, low fat foods given in frequent small meals.","High fiber foods given in frequent small meals.","Foods low in soluble fiber.","Foods low in insoluble fiber."]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.720Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758603689159-33', 'anki-deck-1783610421391-1790433139851-sw8ch', 'Why are high-fiber foods more likely than low-fiber foods to cause GI discomfort?*', 'High fiber foods may delay gastric emptying and lead to excessive gas production.', '', '["High fiber foods may delay gastric emptying and lead to excessive gas production.","High fiber foods often contain more fat and lactose.","Low fiber foods are mildly seasoned foods.","Low fiber foods are liquid diets."]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.720Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
