('anki-card-1758603643877-30', 'anki-deck-1783610421391-1790433139851-sw8ch', 'Which of the following statements describe both clear and full liquid diets?*', 'They are deficient in nutrients and are temporary diets.', '', '["They can be used for long periods of time.","They are deficient in nutrients and are temporary diets.","They are contraindicated for people experiencing GI disturbances.","They are contraindicated for people who are unable to chew and swallow whole foods."]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.720Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758603622462-29', 'anki-deck-1783610421391-1790433139851-sw8ch', 'A person who eats a protein-rich diet centered on meat is highly unlikely to be deficient in which of the following:*', 'Niacin', '', '["Folate","Vitamin C","Niacin","Vitamin E"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.720Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758603604296-28', 'anki-deck-1783610421391-1790433139851-sw8ch', 'Which of the following statements correctly describes an appropriate diet for acute stress?*', 'Although the diet must supply adequate energy, energy needs are generally not exceptionally high immediately following stress, except for some people with extensive burns or head injuries.', '', '["The diet is always high in kilocalories.","The diet has little effect on blood glucose levels.","The amounts of carbohydrates, protein and fats that supply energy make little difference.","Although the diet must supply adequate energy, energy needs are generally not exceptionally high immediately following stress, except for some people with extensive burns or head injuries."]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.720Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758603584215-27', 'anki-deck-1783610421391-1790433139851-sw8ch', 'The electrolytes that may rise in the blood following an acute stress and then plummet as stress resolves include:*', 'Potassium and phosphorus', '', '["Sodium and potassium","Calcium and magnesium","Potassium and phosphorus","Phosphorus, iron and zinc"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.720Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758603552965-25', 'anki-deck-1783610421391-1790433139851-sw8ch', 'Which of the following statements with respect to nutrition and severe stress is true?*', 'A previously well-nourished person can develop acute malnutrition if the stress is extreme and prolonged.', '', '["A person with pre-existing malnutrition who suffers an acute stress does not require immediate attention to energy and nutrient needs.","A previously well-nourished person can develop acute malnutrition if the stress is extreme and prolonged.","A person with either acute or pre-existing malnutrition has the energy reserves and protein needed to respond successfully to stress.","A person with malnutrition who suffers an acute stress always needs tube feedings or TPN."]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.720Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758603527984-24', 'anki-deck-1783610421391-1790433139851-sw8ch', 'The immune system fails to control a local infection following an acute stress, the most serious complication but can occur from the list below is:*', 'Sepsis', '', '["Sepsis","Catabolism of protein","essential fatty acid deficiency","low serum albumin and transferrin"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.720Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758603502668-23', 'anki-deck-1783610421391-1790433139851-sw8ch', 'Which of the following metabolic changes accompany acute stress?*', 'Proteins broken down in skeletal muscle, connective tissue, and the gut.', '', '["Proteins are broke down in the liver.","Protein synthesis in the liver decreases.","The body conserves protein as it does in simple fasting.","Proteins broken down in skeletal muscle, connective tissue, and the gut."]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.720Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758603475951-21', 'anki-deck-1783610421391-1790433139851-sw8ch', 'Which of the following complications of diabetes affects biochemical nutrition assessment parameters?*', 'Renal failure', '', '["Gastroparesis","Renal failure","Neuropathy","Retinopathy"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.720Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
