('anki-card-1758603446918-19', 'anki-deck-1783610421391-1790433139851-sw8ch', 'Clients with type 1 diabetes differ from type 2 diabetes in that they:*', 'Are prone to ketoacidosis.', '', '["Tend to be overweight.","Are prone to ketoacidosis.","Have some remaining insulin production.","Tend to develop diabetes later in life (after age 30)"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.720Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758603426854-18', 'anki-deck-1783610421391-1790433139851-sw8ch', 'Which of the following is true regarding the use of alcohol in a diet for diabetes?*', 'Alcohol can cause hypoglycaemia in all people, including those with diabetes.', '', '["A serving of alcohol is always considered part of the carbohydrate allowance.","Alcohol can cause hypoglycaemia in all people, including those with diabetes.","People with well-controlled blood glucose levels should refrain from alcohol use.","In combination with alcohol, some types of insulin can cause a disulfiram-like reaction among type 2 diabetes."]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.720Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758603399472-17', 'anki-deck-1783610421391-1790433139851-sw8ch', 'The diabetes educator working with a client with diabetes emphasizes that the diet should provide:*', 'A consistent carbohydrate intake from day-to-day and at each meal and snack.', '', '["A very low intake of fat.","More protein than regular diets.","A restricted intake of simple sugars and concentrated sweets.","A consistent carbohydrate intake from day-to-day and at each meal and snack."]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.720Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758603378905-16', 'anki-deck-1783610421391-1790433139851-sw8ch', 'All of the following statements are true regarding physical activity and diabetes except:*', 'People with type 1 diabetes can improve cardiovascular health through a program of regular physical activity.', '', '["People with type 2 diabetes can improve blood glucose control through a regular program of physical activity.","People with type 1 diabetes can improve blood glucose control through a regular program of physical activity.","Physical activity helps control weight, BP and blood lipids.","People with type 1 diabetes can improve cardiovascular health through a program of regular physical activity."]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:28.720Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
