('anki-card-1756168980834-18', 'anki-deck-1783609175539-1790433140277-2y6kw', 'In terms of pricing, breakfast combo meals could be classified under this type of menu:', 'Table d''hote', 'The main difference between a la Carte and table d hote is that the à la Carte is a menu type having a wide variety of courses that are individually priced whereas the table d’hôte is a menu type usually with a set number of courses, all for a set price.', '["Table d''hote","Ala carte","Du jour","Semi-ala carte"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'easy', 5, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-19T20:00:00.000Z","interval":49,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":4}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.104Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T16:40:43.813Z"'::jsonb),
