('anki-card-1756168517884-10', 'anki-deck-1783609175539-1790433140277-2y6kw', 'It refers to all conditions and measures necessary to ensure safety and suitability of food at all stages of the food chain.', 'Food hygiene', 'Food hygiene comprises conditions and measures necessary for the production, processing, storage, and distribution of food designed to ensure a safe, sound, and wholesome product fit for human consumption.', '["Food hygiene","Food safety","Food sanitation","HACCP"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'easy', 5, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-16T20:00:00.000Z","interval":46,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":4}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.104Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T16:37:48.017Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756171025120-37', 'anki-deck-1783609175539-1790433140277-2y6kw', 'An inventory system when an item is allowed to deplete to safety level before new order is submitted to bring up level up to maximum.', 'Minimax', 'Minimax system means that an item is allowed to deplete to safety level before new order is submitted to bring up level up to maximum.

In foodservice inventory management, the Minimax system establishes two primary stock triggers for each item: a minimum safety level (the floor) and a maximum capacity level (the ceiling). Stock is deliberately allowed to deplete until it hits that lower safety margin. Once it reaches that precise reorder point, a fresh order is generated to purchase exactly enough supply to restore the inventory back up to its defined maximum limit.

• Partially blind method: This is a technique used during physical inventory receiving where the clerk is given an invoice or PO showing the item names but with some quantities blocked out, forcing them to do a blind, independent count.
• Economic order quantity (EOQ): This is a mathematical formula used to determine the absolute most cost-effective amount of inventory to order by perfectly balancing holding costs against ordering costs. It focuses on cost optimization rather than a strict minimum-to-maximum safety cutoff loop.
• Par stock: Unlike the fluctuating buffer of the minimax system, par stock requires a set, fixed total quantity of an item to be physically present on the shelves at any given time. Every single time a replenishment order is placed, a purchase is made to bring the stock right back up to that static "par" number.', '["Minimax","Par stock","Partially blind method","Economic order quantity"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-11-01T15:03:29.093Z","interval":3,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":3}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-29T15:03:29.093Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.104Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-29T15:03:29.093Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756168292230-6', 'anki-deck-1783609175539-1790433140277-2y6kw', 'Type of menu commonly used in institution where the menu is repeated within a specified time span.', 'Cycle menu', 'Cycle or cyclical offers menu in rotation for a period of 6 to 30 days. Menu items are repeated at the end of a specified period. Most typically offered by non-commercial foodservices but may also be used by commercial buffet restaurants. It must be flexible to include leftovers or account for seasonal ingredients.', '["Cycle menu","Single-use menu","Selective menu","Static menu"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'easy', 5, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-19T20:00:00.000Z","interval":49,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":4}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.104Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T16:39:33.469Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756168447789-9', 'anki-deck-1783609175539-1790433140277-2y6kw', 'The cost incurred by an operation that includes rent, depreciation, utlities, etc.', 'Operating cost', 'Operating or overhead costs are costs other than food and labor. This includes utilities, repairs and maintenance, cleaning materials, rent, depreciation, taxes, insurance, etc.', '["Operating cost","Labor cost","Fixed cost","Food cost"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'easy', 5, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-19T20:00:00.000Z","interval":49,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":3}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.104Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T16:35:55.131Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756168391309-8', 'anki-deck-1783609175539-1790433140277-2y6kw', 'ISO standard of ensuring efficient, safe, and cleaner product and services:', '22000', 'The ISO 22000 is the comprehensive and internationally recognized standard for management systems in the food industry. With certification according to ISO 22000:2018 you guarantee the quality and safety of food along the entire production chain. From primary producers to transport companies, subcontractors, food manufacturers and retail.', '["22000","9000","1400","2001"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'easy', 5, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-17T20:00:00.000Z","interval":47,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":4}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.104Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T16:35:36.255Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756168230048-5', 'anki-deck-1783609175539-1790433140277-2y6kw', 'In this style of tableservice, all food are prepared and portioned in the kitchen and attractively arranged on serving platters. Food is served to individual plates using cutleries.', 'Russian', 'Russian style of service entails fully preparing food in the kitchen and placed in platters for service to guests.', '["Russian","French","American","Blue plate"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'easy', 5, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-18T20:00:00.000Z","interval":48,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":4}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.104Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T16:40:59.099Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756168154885-4', 'anki-deck-1783609175539-1790433140277-2y6kw', 'Example of fixed or built-in equipment for delivery and service.', 'Dumbwaiter', 'A dumbwaiter is a small freight elevator or lift intended to carry food. Dumbwaiters found within modern structures, including both commercial, public and private buildings, are often connected between multiple floors.', '["Dumbwaiter","Portable totes","Pellet disc","Carts"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'easy', 5, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-18T20:00:00.000Z","interval":48,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":4}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.104Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T16:37:29.071Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756168107172-3', 'anki-deck-1783609175539-1790433140277-2y6kw', 'Food is served and prepared under one roof. There is little time between food preparation and service.', 'Conventional', 'Conventional food system entails preparing and serving food in one roof thereby having little time between preparation and service.', '["Conventional","Commissary","Assembly","Ready prepared"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'easy', 5, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-18T20:00:00.000Z","interval":48,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":5}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.104Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T16:35:12.303Z"'::jsonb),
