('anki-card-1757929355648-50', 'anki-deck-1783609425474-1790433136742-1d3n3', 'To be a success, planning the menu must first of all regarded as a  marketing exercise. This exercise needs to be carried out in conjunction with certain important rules, like:
(1) it should complement the establishment’s image
