('anki-card-1754880843733-2', 'anki-deck-1783608681588-1790433140276-5f3w7', 'Josh is obese. Upon plotting his weight on the growth chart, what is the direction of the curve?', 'Outside the upper reference line', '', '["Outside the lower reference line","Outside the upper reference line","Flat curve","Falling curve"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-08-12T20:00:00.000Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":2}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.763Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
