('anki-card-1757931200644-34', 'anki-deck-1783609398838-1790433146200-hye2o', 'Which of the following is the most effective and least costly strategy for preventing an iron deficiency?*', 'Eat small quantities of meat, fish, and poultry frequently together with liberal amounts of vegetables and legumes.', '', '["Consume iron supplements at a level 2-3 times the RENI.","Switch to iron cooking utensils and eat at least 4 servings of red meat daily.","Eat small amounts of citrus products and increase intake of low-fat milk.","Eat small quantities of meat, fish, and poultry frequently together with liberal amounts of vegetables and legumes."]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.883Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
