('anki-card-1757931086383-25', 'anki-deck-1783609398838-1790433146200-hye2o', 'Which of the following describes a way to make an electrolyte solution?*', 'Dissolve a teaspoon of salt in a glass of water.', '', '["Dissolve a teaspoon of salt in a glass of water.","Vigorously shake a mixture of corn oil and water.","Dissolve a pinch of cornstarch in a glass of water.","Vigorously shake a pinch of table sugar in warm water."]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.883Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757931073867-24', 'anki-deck-1783609398838-1790433146200-hye2o', 'All of the following are properties of electrolytes except*', 'They include fat-soluble as well as water-soluble particles.', '', '["They attract water.","They are charged particles.","They carry electrical current.","They include fat-soluble as well as water-soluble particles."]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.883Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1757931061633-23', 'anki-deck-1783609398838-1790433146200-hye2o', 'Which of the following features do vitamins C and E share?*', 'Both function as antioxidants.', '', '["Both function as antioxidants.","Both require bile for absorption.","Neither participates in protein synthesis","Neither is affected by the processing of foods"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.883Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
