('anki-card-1758530755177-50', 'anki-deck-1783609212880-1790433142620-mxyd7', 'Labor cost is considered a ______ cost.*', 'Fixed', '', '["Fixed","Variable","Prime","Non controllable"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.930Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758530877436-58', 'anki-deck-1783609212880-1790433142620-mxyd7', 'Which action is contrary to the principle of homogenous assignment ? *', 'Assign an employee to perform several secondary unrelated jobs.', '', '["Group workers who perform similar functions","Limit the variety of jobs assigned to an employee","Assign an employee to perform several secondary unrelated jobs.","Reduce employees’ job inefficiency and confusion"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.930Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758530889488-59', 'anki-deck-1783609212880-1790433142620-mxyd7', 'Which of the following information is not reflected in the organizational chart?*', 'Specific responsibilities of managers', '', '["Duplication of functions","An overloaded manager","Important functions neglected or overstressed","Specific responsibilities of managers"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.930Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758530909003-60', 'anki-deck-1783609212880-1790433142620-mxyd7', 'A manager who waits for situations to arise before taking action is described as ______ manager. *', 'reactive', '', '["doer","proactive","facilitator","reactive"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.930Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758530931935-61', 'anki-deck-1783609212880-1790433142620-mxyd7', 'Which statement does not conform with the traditional principles of management?*', 'Employees can receive orders from different bosses.', '', '["The interest of the organization is more important than those of any individual/group in the organization.","Decision making authority should rest at the top level of the organization","The same plan should be followed for a group of activities that have the same goal or objective.","Employees can receive orders from different bosses."]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.930Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758531082512-72', 'anki-deck-1783609212880-1790433142620-mxyd7', 'An employee’s dissatisfaction for unjust company disciplinary action against him is called a....*', 'grievance', '', '["disciplinary action","corrective action","discipline","grievance"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.930Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758531100094-73', 'anki-deck-1783609212880-1790433142620-mxyd7', 'A corrective action by the company to make employees understand and follow company rules.*', 'Discipline', '', '["Discipline","Corrective action","Corrective interview","Grievance"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.930Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758531262220-84', 'anki-deck-1783609212880-1790433142620-mxyd7', 'In today’s workplace, the main link/s between the company’s goals and the people who must accomplish these goals are *', 'the supervisors', '', '["the employees","the vendors","the customers","the supervisors"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.930Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758531282452-85', 'anki-deck-1783609212880-1790433142620-mxyd7', 'A supervisor is likely to lose the trust and confidence of his/her employees if*', 'he/she demonstrates any or all of the above listed behaviors', '', '["he/she is not consistent with what he says or does","he/she is always after personal gain","he/she withholds in formation and is prone to lying and half truths","he/she demonstrates any or all of the above listed behaviors"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.930Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758531313051-86', 'anki-deck-1783609212880-1790433142620-mxyd7', 'Resolving conflicts is likened to the job of a firefighter. The first step in resolving a conflict is to .*', 'contain the problem and prevent it from going out of hand', '', '["contain the problem and prevent it from going out of hand","get rid of the problem","look for a win-win solution","let emotions settle down first, before attempting to attack the problem"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.930Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758531335184-87', 'anki-deck-1783609212880-1790433142620-mxyd7', 'The saying: “you can take a horse to the water, but you cannot force it to drink” means ______.*', '“we need to motivate and inspire our employees so that they will develop an inner drive to perform without being pushed”', '', '["“our employees must be competent in their job”","“employees must be treated like a work horse, so that they will always follow what we say”","“we need to understand the psychology of our employees”","“we need to motivate and inspire our employees so that they will develop an inner drive to perform without being pushed”"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.930Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758531353282-88', 'anki-deck-1783609212880-1790433142620-mxyd7', 'Which of the following can make an office memo less effective?*', 'Writing a lengthy memo on varied subjects', '', '["Writing a lengthy memo on varied subjects","Indicating the subject of the memo","Indicating the intended receiver and source of the memo","Stating the message clearly and straight to the point"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.930Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758531371496-89', 'anki-deck-1783609212880-1790433142620-mxyd7', 'A job analysis is used for the following purposes, except*', 'to determine job satisfaction level of employees.', '', '["to guide in employee recruitment, selection and placement.","to outline employee job opportunities within the company.","to provide information on possible training needs/programs to be conducted.","to determine job satisfaction level of employees."]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.930Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758531401697-90', 'anki-deck-1783609212880-1790433142620-mxyd7', 'A supervisor got this advice to promote effective communication in the workplace: “ listen to the whispers and you won ’t have to hear the screams”. What does this statement mean?*', 'Give importance to small issues to prevent them from becoming big issues later on.', '', '["Always pay attention to the big issues.","Listen to everything your staff is whispering to you.","Give importance to small issues to prevent them from becoming big issues later on.","Be conscious of what people are saying behind your back."]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.930Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758531423095-91', 'anki-deck-1783609212880-1790433142620-mxyd7', 'Which of the following information is not true about a job description?*', 'It gives information on rules and regulations related to the job', '', '["It contains information on what the job is and the specific duties involved","It shows the responsibilities and general conditions related to the job","It defines the scope of a job, and sets boundaries between positions","It gives information on rules and regulations related to the job"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.930Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1758530814126-55', 'anki-deck-1783609212880-1790433142620-mxyd7', 'The principle which states that “each employee must know to whom he reports”, refers to*', 'unity of command', 'Unity of command prevents conflicting directives, ambiguity in accountability, and operational confusion by establishing a singular, direct line of authority where a subordinate receives orders from and is accountable to only one immediate superior. In clinical and foodservice management, this structural hierarchy ensures clear communication channels, precise delegation of tasks, and efficient chain-of-command execution during critical operational or patient care workflows.', '["departmentation","delegation of authority","unity of command","delegation of responsibility"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-30T02:54:03.484Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-09-29T02:54:03.484Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.930Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-29T02:54:03.484Z"'::jsonb),
