('anki-card-1756880789065-91', 'anki-deck-1783609411469-1790433139866-aqx4l', 'Which of the following best explains the distinction between spices and herbs in culinary use?', 'Herbs are primarily leafy and used fresh or dried; spices come from other plant parts like seeds and bark', '', '["Spices are always stronger in flavor and must be used in larger quantities","Herbs are derived from dried roots while spices come from stems","Herbs are primarily leafy and used fresh or dried; spices come from other plant parts like seeds and bark","There is no clear difference; both terms are interchangeable in recipes"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.986Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756880807713-92', 'anki-deck-1783609411469-1790433139866-aqx4l', 'Why is pork belly barbecue generally more tender and juicy than tenderloin barbecue, even though tenderloin is a leaner and more tender cut?', 'Pork belly has higher fat content that melts during cooking, adding moisture and flavor', '', '["Pork belly has less connective tissue, making it easier to cook","Tenderloin retains more moisture due to its low fat content","Pork belly has higher fat content that melts during cooking, adding moisture and flavor","Tenderloin absorbs more marinade, making it taste richer and juicier"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:29.986Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
