('anki-card-1758606143444-30', 'anki-deck-1783610451953-1790433140293-winqs', 'Processing at sea level or any altitude below 1000 ft takes 10 minutes. If an additional minute of processing is required for each additional 1000 feet
elevation, what is the processing time in Baguio which is 6000 feet above sea level?*', '15 minutes

1. Identify the baseline time
Processing up to 1,000 feet requires a baseline of 10 minutes.

2. Calculate the additional elevation
Baguio is at 6,000 feet. Subtracting the baseline 1,000 feet gives the total additional elevation:
Additional Elevation = 6,000 ft - 1,000 ft = 5,000 ft

3. Determine the additional processing minutes
Since 1 extra minute is needed for each additional 1,000 feet:
Additional Minutes = 5,000 ft / 1,000 ft = 5 minutes

4. Calculate total processing time
Total Time = 10 minutes (baseline) + 5 minutes (additional) = 15 minutes', '', '["16 minutes","15 minutes","14 minutes","17 minutes"]'::jsonb, '["Nutritional Biochemistry"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.006Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
