('anki-card-1758685959045-149', 'anki-deck-1783608782087-1790433140508-zgaqi', 'When expressed per kilogram body weight, the nutrient needs of infants are markedly higher than for adults for all of the following nutrients except: *', 'folate', '', '["iron","folate","calcium","vitamin D"]'::jsonb, '["Public Health & Community"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.008Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
