('anki-card-1755153747380-52', 'anki-deck-1755151710403-1790432463944-n11t8', 'Raw starch flavor is caused by:', 'Lumping', 'A raw starch flavor results when a starch mixture form lumps that could be due to inadequate stirring or cooking. Formation of lumps can cause uneven hydration and gelatinization.

