('anki-card-1788420679946-49', 'anki-deck-1788419227999-1790433139849-6x509', 'According to the latest NNS results, binge drinking, 58.7% of Filipino adults are binge drinkers. Binge drinking is defined as the excessive consumption of alcoholic beverages, specifically the intake of ___ or more (females) or ____ or more(males) standard drinks in a row by those who reported drinking alcoholic beverages in the past 30 days.', 'four, five', 'The excessive consumption of alcoholic beverages, specifically the intake of four or more (females) or five or more (males) standard drinks in a row by those who reported drinking alcoholic beverages in the past 30 days.', '["four, five","two, three","three, four","five, six"]'::jsonb, '["General Dietetics"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 2, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-10-28T12:49:10.934Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":1}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-27T12:49:10.934Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:30.220Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-27T12:49:11.299Z"'::jsonb),
