('anki-card-1758813419532-136', 'anki-deck-1783608806858-1790433140285-ai0do', 'Refer to the following: An investigator would like to examine the following research question: “Association between dietary intake of coconut oil and coconut products with hypertension and dyslipidemia among 20-60 year-old adults in Regions 2 and 5.”
