('anki-card-1756876064514-83', 'anki-deck-1783609405436-1790433139823-mldgr', 'Job shadowing is a commonly used training method in foodservice operations. What is job shadowing?', 'When a trainee learns from a more experience employee by following anf observing him as he does his daily work', '', '["When a more experienced mentor is assigned to coach the trainee","When employees are orated from one job to another, to learn and familiarize themselves with different jobs","When a trainee attends several training sessions conducted by experienced employees acting as mentors","When a trainee learns from a more experience employee by following anf observing him as he does his daily work"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:35:40.426Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
