('anki-card-1756876217375-91', 'anki-deck-1783609405436-1790433139823-mldgr', 'An Italian royalty credited for the development of French cuisine. She married the King of France, and moved to live there, bringing with her, her Italian chefs and knowledge of food preparation and service, which spawned the development of French Cuisine. 



