('anki-card-1756874319579-4', 'anki-deck-1783609405436-1790433139823-mldgr', 'Which statement is not true about popularity index?', 'It indicates the need to increase portion size of items served.', '', '["It tells us how popular or acceptable a particular entrée is, at a particular period.","It guides us in projecting future sales for a particular entrée.","It signifies a trend in menu selection if the results are recurring.","It indicates the need to increase portion size of items served."]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:35:40.426Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756874355077-5', 'anki-deck-1783609405436-1790433139823-mldgr', 'A Chicken Macaroni soup recipe yields 6 quarts and portion size is ¾ cup. How many portions will this recipe make?', '32 portions

1. Convert quarts to cups: There are 4 cups in 1 quart.
6 quarts x 4 cups/quart = 24 total cups
2. Divide by the portion size: Divide the total amount of cups by the size of each portion.
24 cups ÷ 3/4 cup = 32 portions', '', '["32 portions","26 portions","40 portions","20 portions"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:35:40.426Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1756876358400-99', 'anki-deck-1783609405436-1790433139823-mldgr', 'This chef is known for having organized the kitchen brigade system and the classical organization of the kitchen.



<img alt="Marie-Antoine Carême - Simple English Wikipedia, the free encyclopedia" src="M-A-Careme.jpg" width="151">A. Marie Antoine Careme



<img alt="Georges Auguste Escoffier''s culinary legacy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," width="134">B. Auguste Escoffier



<img alt="Jean Anthelme Brillat-Savarin Facts for Kids" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," width="190">C. Anthelme Brillat Savarin



<img alt="Varenne (François Pierre de La)" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," width="149">D. Francois Pierre La Varenne', 'Auguste Escoffier
<img alt="Georges Auguste Escoffier''s culinary legacy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," width="134">

❌ Marie Antoine Carême: Known for codifying French haute cuisine, defining the early mother sauces, and creating elaborate pastry centerpieces (pièces montées).
❌ Anthelme Brillat-Savarin: A famous French lawyer and politician who became one of the world''s most celebrated epicures and food philosophers (famous for the quote, "Tell me what you eat, and I will tell you what you are").
❌ François Pierre La Varenne: A 17th-century chef who broke away from heavily spiced medieval cooking, wrote Le Cuisinier François, and laid the foundational roots for early modern French cuisine.', '', '["Auguste Escoffier\n<img alt=\"Georges Auguste Escoffier''s culinary legacy\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" width=\"134\">\n\n❌ Marie Antoine Carême: Known for codifying French haute cuisine, defining the early mother sauces, and creating elaborate pastry centerpieces (pièces montées).\n❌ Anthelme Brillat-Savarin: A famous French lawyer and politician who became one of the world''s most celebrated epicures and food philosophers (famous for the quote, \"Tell me what you eat, and I will tell you what you are\").\n❌ François Pierre La Varenne: A 17th-century chef who broke away from heavily spiced medieval cooking, wrote Le Cuisinier François, and laid the foundational roots for early modern French cuisine.","garde manger","controlling food cost for employees’ meals","To clean the storeroom"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 1, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z","interval":1,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":0}'::jsonb, NULL, '"2026-09-26T14:35:40.426Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-09-26T14:32:12.431Z"'::jsonb),
