('anki-card-1756876335585-98', 'anki-deck-1783609405436-1790433139823-mldgr', 'He is a known as the Father of Canning, who made possible the preservation of food and prevention of food spoilage using hermetically sealed containers, and in 1809 made possible  preservation of food for the use of the army and navy in France. 



<img alt="The History of Delmonico''s | America''s Original Steakhouse Since 1837" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," width="200">A. Delmonico



