('anki-card-1756874377826-6', 'anki-deck-1783609405436-1790433139823-mldgr', 'As Purchased (AP) weight of Ox Tongue is 4 kilos and 700 grams. Edible weight after trimming and tenderizing is 3 kilos and 150 grams. Yield percentage is?', '67%

