<img alt="Why Outdoor Griddle Cooking Is Changing the Game for Foodies | Outeriors" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," width="198">d. Griddle', 'Steam-jacketed kettle', '• Salamander: primarily used for broiling or finishing foods.
• Bain-marie: suited to gentle heating or holding rather than primary large-volume soup production.
• Griddle: designed for direct cooking on a heated flat surface.', '["Steam-jacketed kettle","Bain-marie","Griddle","Salamander"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 5, '', '{"dueDate":"2028-01-20T15:12:07.837Z","interval":448,"easeFactor":2.3,"repetitions":8}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-29T15:12:07.837Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T15:43:12.925Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-29T15:12:08.035Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1788425959275-54', 'anki-deck-1788422977034-1791992590890-w1g2h', 'Compute the percent shrinkage of pork kasim if the raw weight is 850 g and the cooked weight is 600 g.', '29%', 'Formula: (raw weight - cooked weight) / raw weight * 100
= (850–600 ÷ 850) × 100 = 29%', '["29%","25%","31%","33%"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 3, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-11-06T13:30:26.792Z","interval":8,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":4}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-29T13:30:26.792Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T15:43:12.925Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-29T13:30:26.792Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1788426348673-59', 'anki-deck-1788422977034-1791992590890-w1g2h', 'A foodservice manager wants to reduce the risk of microbial growth in cooked food during preparation, holding, and service. Which practice best demonstrates proper time-temperature control?', 'Monitoring food temperatures and minimizing the time food remains at unsafe temperatures', 'Foodborne pathogens multiply rapidly in the Temperature Danger Zone, which is between 41°F and 135°F (5°C to 57°C).

Proper time-temperature control for safety (TCS) requires food managers to constantly measure temperatures using food thermometers and ensure that foods move through or stay out of this danger zone as quickly as possible to prevent dangerous microbial growth.', '["Monitoring food temperatures and minimizing the time food remains at unsafe temperatures","Checking on appearance and odor to determine whether food is safe","Storing cooked food to remain at room temperature until needed","Keeping all foods at the same temperature regardless of whether they are served hot or cold to save storage space"]'::jsonb, '["Food Service Systems"]'::jsonb, NULL, 'hard', 3, '', '{"dueDate":"2026-11-06T13:29:29.379Z","interval":8,"easeFactor":2.5,"repetitions":4}'::jsonb, '"2026-10-29T13:29:29.379Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-14T15:43:12.925Z"'::jsonb, '"2026-10-29T13:29:29.379Z"'::jsonb),
('anki-card-1788424909437-41', 'anki-deck-1788422977034-1791992590890-w1g2h', 'French restaurateur and father of Classic Cuisine.


<img alt="Georges Auguste Escoffier''s culinary legacy" src="data:image/jpeg;base64," width="135">a. Auguste Escoffier
