('mc:considered the father of industrial catering.:::robert owen', 'considered the father of industrial catering.', 'Robert Owen', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"In the 1800s, Robert Owen put up a kitchen and eating room for his workers starting the idea of employee meal subsidy thus he is referred to as the Father of Industrial Catering (Scotland).","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Robert Owen\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"In the 1800s, Robert Owen put up a kitchen and eating room for his workers starting the idea of employee meal subsidy thus he is referred to as the Father of Industrial Catering (Scotland).","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Escoffier, Boulanger, Alexis Soyer"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
