('mc:the most practical type of storage in small stores is::::reach-in chiller', 'the most practical type of storage in small stores is:', 'Reach-in chiller', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Reach-in units are used to store food products at point-of-use or used in central storage units in small operations.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Reach-in chiller\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Reach-in units are used to store food products at point-of-use or used in central storage units in small operations.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Blast chiller, Walk-in chiller, Chest freezer"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
('mc:a set of waste management practices which aims to safely and effectively handle the municipal solid waste stream with the least adverse impact on human health and the environment.:::integrated solid waste management', 'a set of waste management practices which aims to safely and effectively handle the municipal solid waste stream with the least adverse impact on human health and the environment.', 'Integrated Solid Waste Management', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Integrated Solid Waste Management is a set of waste management practices which aims to safely and effectively handle the municipal solid waste stream with the least adverse impact on human health and the environment. ","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Integrated Solid Waste Management\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Integrated Solid Waste Management is a set of waste management practices which aims to safely and effectively handle the municipal solid waste stream with the least adverse impact on human health and the environment. \n\n• Republic Act No. 9003 “Ecological Solid Waste Management Act of 2000”. \n• Zero Waste Management Strategy - aims to achieve zero waste of resources; to eliminate solid waste, hazardous waste, emissions, toxic wastes and others; to eliminate waste at source and at all points down the production and supply chains rather than management of the wastes created in the process.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: RA No. 9003, Reuse, Reduce, Recycle, Zero Waste Management Strategy"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
