('mc:under pd 856, the minimum kitchen size for a 40 m² dining area is (m²)::::10', 'under pd 856, the minimum kitchen size for a 40 m² dining area is (m²):', '10', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Rule: The kitchen area must be at least 1/4 (25%) of the total dining area, but it cannot fall below a baseline minimum of 9.30 m² (100 sq. ft.).","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"10\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Rule: The kitchen area must be at least 1/4 (25%) of the total dining area, but it cannot fall below a baseline minimum of 9.30 m² (100 sq. ft.).\n\nCalculated Kitchen Area = 40 m² x 0.25 = 10 m²","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: 5, 15, 20"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
