('mc:the main bases for space allocation::::menu', 'the main bases for space allocation:', 'Menu', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Menu serves as the basis for physical factors like equipment, kitchen space, layout and sanitation.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Menu\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Menu serves as the basis for physical factors like equipment, kitchen space, layout and sanitation.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Type of equipment material, Quantity of equipment, Manpower"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
