('mc:the first symptom of vitamin a deficiency affecting vision.:::nyctalopia', 'the first symptom of vitamin a deficiency affecting vision.', 'Nyctalopia', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Nyctalopia is also called as night blindness. Manifestations of Vitamin A deficiency include eye defects including nyctalopia as the first symptom affecting vision.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Nyctalopia\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Nyctalopia is also called as night blindness. Manifestations of Vitamin A deficiency include eye defects including nyctalopia as the first symptom affecting vision.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Conjunctivitis, Corneal Xerosis"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
