('mc:component of enzyme that is involved in purine metabolism.:::molybdenum', 'component of enzyme that is involved in purine metabolism.', 'Molybdenum', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Molybdenum is a cofactor for aldehyde oxidase, which participates in metabolism of purines.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Molybdenum\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Molybdenum is a cofactor for aldehyde oxidase, which participates in metabolism of purines.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Manganese, Copper"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
