h, smoky flavor with a complex blend of spices.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Linat-an, Batchoy, Piarun"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb)
