 or used first before newer stock (last-in). This approach helps prevent inventory from becoming obsolete and is often used for perishable goods.\n\nBuffer System:\nDescription: Also known as a safety stock system, this approach involves maintaining an additional quantity of stock (buffer or safety stock) to protect against variations in demand or supply delays. It ensures that there is always a reserve to cover unexpected changes.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: FIFO, Min-Max system, Buffer system"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
('mc:gas that cause the fruit to ripen::::', 'gas that cause the fruit to ripen:', NULL, true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Ethylene is a natural plant hormone that plays a key role in the ripening process of fruits. It is produced by fruits themselves as they ripen and can also be released by other fruits nearby, leading to a chain reaction of ripening in a group of fruits.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"ethylene\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Ethylene is a natural plant hormone that plays a key role in the ripening process of fruits. It is produced by fruits themselves as they ripen and can also be released by other fruits nearby, leading to a chain reaction of ripening in a group of fruits.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: carbon monoxide, propane, nitrogen"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
('mc:the following are functional subsystems of a traditional food service operation, except::::packaging', 'the following are functional subsystems of a traditional food service operation, except:', 'Packaging', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Packaging is not typically considered a functional subsystem within a traditional food service operation. While food packaging is essential in certain contexts (such as retail food products or take-out services), traditional food service operations primarily focus on preparing and serving food rather than packaging it for distribution or sale.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Packaging\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Packaging is not typically considered a functional subsystem within a traditional food service operation. While food packaging is essential in certain contexts (such as retail food products or take-out services), traditional food service operations primarily focus on preparing and serving food rather than packaging it for distribution or sale.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Production, Storage and Inventory, Sanitation and Maintenance"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
