('mc:a function of public health nutritionist which focuses on assisting the community in identification of their needs and help them realizing their nutrition and nutrition-related problems.:::assessor', 'a function of public health nutritionist which focuses on assisting the community in identification of their needs and help them realizing their nutrition and nutrition-related problems.', 'Assessor', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Assessor centers on assessment by helping the community identify and recognize its own nutrition and nutrition-related problems as a first step in program planning. ","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Assessor\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Assessor centers on assessment by helping the community identify and recognize its own nutrition and nutrition-related problems as a first step in program planning. \n\n• Organizer focuses on mobilizing resources and stakeholder. \n• Implementer focuses on carrying out planned interventions. \n• Educator focuses on transmitting knowledge and skills.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Organizer, Implementer, Educator"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
