('mc:the main role of public health nutritionist is:::nutrition program planner and manager', 'the main role of public health nutritionist is', 'Nutrition program planner and manager', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"While a Registered Dietitian-Nutritionist (RDN) can work across various fields, public health nutrition focuses specifically on populations and communities rather than individual patients.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Nutrition program planner and manager\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"While a Registered Dietitian-Nutritionist (RDN) can work across various fields, public health nutrition focuses specifically on populations and communities rather than individual patients.\n\nThe primary responsibility of a public health nutritionist is macro-level intervention. This includes assessing the nutritional needs of a community, designing health promotion programs, securing resources, and managing large-scale implementation to reduce disease risks across a population.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Diet counselor, Foodservice manager, All of the above"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
