('mc:a function of public health nutritionist which focuses on financial management and organizing the personnel who are involve in nutrition program implementation.:::program administrator', 'a function of public health nutritionist which focuses on financial management and organizing the personnel who are involve in nutrition program implementation.', 'Program Administrator', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Program administrator manages the daily operations.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Program Administrator\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Program administrator manages the daily operations.\n\n• Program planner - designs the program strategy\n• Program organizer - assembles necessary resources\n• Program implementer - delivers the program activities","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Program planner, Program Organizer, Program Implementer"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
