('mc:when was the first nutrition survey released?:::1910', 'when was the first nutrition survey released?', '1910', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"The first nutrition survey results were released in 1910 during the American Regime, which primarily focused on investigating beriberi and its links to eating polished white rice.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"1910\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"The first nutrition survey results were released in 1910 during the American Regime, which primarily focused on investigating beriberi and its links to eating polished white rice.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: 1920, 1930, 1940"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
('mc:who was the first secretary of department of health and welfare?:::dr. jose fabella', 'who was the first secretary of department of health and welfare?', 'Dr. Jose Fabella', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Dr. Jose Fabella is a Filipino physician and public health leader, known as the \"Father of Public Health\" in the Philippines. He served as the first Secretary of Health.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Dr. Jose Fabella\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Dr. Jose Fabella is a Filipino physician and public health leader, known as the \"Father of Public Health\" in the Philippines. He served as the first Secretary of Health.\n\n• Dr. Francisco O. Santos - A Filipino chemist and agricultural scientist, recognized as the \"Father of Human Nutrition\" in the Philippines.\n• Dr. Juan Salcedo, Jr. - A prominent Filipino physician, researcher, and public health advocate; he led early efforts against Vitamin B1 deficiency and served as Secretary of Health and Chairman of the National Science Development Board.\n• Dr. Coronado R. Pascual - A Filipino nutritionist and physician who served as the Director of the Food and Nutrition Research Institute (FNRI) formerly NI and was a key figure in Philippine national nutrition planning.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Dr. Francisco O. Santos, Dr. Juan Salcedo Jr., Dr. Coronado R. Pascual"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
('mc:the primary building substance of cell is::::', 'the primary building substance of cell is:', NULL, true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Protein - structure & function: acts as enzymes to catalyze reactions, builds structural components, and performs transport/movement.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Protein\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Protein - structure & function: acts as enzymes to catalyze reactions, builds structural components, and performs transport/movement.\n\n• Water: for solvent & medium: provides the environment for all chemical reactions (cytoplasm) and acts as a transport mechanism.\n• Fats – for boundary & energy storage: primary component of the cell membrane (boundary) and long-term energy reserve.\n• Carbohydrates – for immediate energy & recognition: the cell''s primary and immediate energy source, also used for cell-to-cell communication.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Water, Fat, Carbohydrates"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
