('mc:something that would prevent an individual from carrying out a recommended response or action.:::barrier', 'something that would prevent an individual from carrying out a recommended response or action.', 'Barrier', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Barrier is an obstacle or cost preventing the desired action.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Barrier\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Barrier is an obstacle or cost preventing the desired action.\n\n• Threat - perceived severity and susceptibility to a health problem.\n• Fear - emotional response to a perceived danger or threat.\n• Intention - commitment or plan to perform a specific behavior.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Threat, Fear, Intention"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
