('mc:which type of audience/s include/s individual or group whom you want to directly reach and influence with your messages?:::primary audience', 'which type of audience/s include/s individual or group whom you want to directly reach and influence with your messages?', 'Primary audience', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Primary audience - group directly targeted and influenced by a nutrition education message.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Primary audience\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Primary audience - group directly targeted and influenced by a nutrition education message.\n\nSecondary audience – those who advise or influence the primary audience rather than being directly targeted themselves.\n\nTertiary audience - those with only a general interest or indirect connection to the message.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Secondary audience, Tertiary audience, All of the above"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
