('mc:why are theories important in nutrition education?:::they are used to shape the nutrition education interventions and answer the "why, what, and how"', 'why are theories important in nutrition education?', 'They are used to shape the nutrition education interventions and answer the "Why, What, and How"', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"The best answer is that theories are used to shape nutrition education interventions and answer the \"why, what, and how\" of behavior change, providing the conceptual foundation for designing effective programs. ","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"They are used to shape the nutrition education interventions and answer the \"Why, What, and How\"\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"The best answer is that theories are used to shape nutrition education interventions and answer the \"why, what, and how\" of behavior change, providing the conceptual foundation for designing effective programs. \n\n• The other choices each describe legitimate but narrower functions of theory (serving as the basis for behavior change, identifying target audiences, or identifying moderators of change), while the correct answer most comprehensively captures theory''s overall guiding role in shaping the full intervention design process.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: They are the bases and center of behavior change, They are useful in identifying target audience of nutrition education, They help nutrition educators identify and modify the specific set of moderators of behavior change"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
