('mc:a good survey sample is one in which::::the subjects are heterogenous', 'a good survey sample is one in which:', 'the subjects are heterogenous', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"In most social, health, and market research, the goal is to have a representative sample that reflects the heterogeneity (diversity) of the larger population.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"the subjects are heterogenous\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"In most social, health, and market research, the goal is to have a representative sample that reflects the heterogeneity (diversity) of the larger population.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: the entire population to be studied is included, all the characteristics of the population are represented proportionately, the subject are willing volunteers"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
