('mc:the survey highlighted a significant burden of malnutrition in the philippines. which of the following is not considered a form of malnutrition in the survey''s findings?:::diabetes', 'the survey highlighted a significant burden of malnutrition in the philippines. which of the following is not considered a form of malnutrition in the survey''s findings?', 'Diabetes', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Diabetes - one of the NCDs; not a form of malnutrition","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Diabetes\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Diabetes - one of the NCDs; not a form of malnutrition","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Stunting, Wasting, Obesity"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
