('mc:sentence a. granules of pure starch are never uniform in size. sentence b. gelatinization point is a range of temperature.:::both sentences are correct', 'sentence a. granules of pure starch are never uniform in size. sentence b. gelatinization point is a range of temperature.', 'Both sentences are correct', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Starch granules naturally vary in size even within the same botanical source. ","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Both sentences are correct\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Starch granules naturally vary in size even within the same botanical source. \n\nGelatinization also occurs over a temperature range rather than at one exact temperature.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Sentence A is correct, Sentence B is correct, Both sentences are incorrect"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
