('mc:to avoid conflict in authority, all workers should::::know to whom they are directly responsible', 'to avoid conflict in authority, all workers should:', 'Know to whom they are directly responsible', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Unity of command requires each worker to know the person to whom they are directly responsible, helping avoid conflicting authority.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Know to whom they are directly responsible\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Unity of command requires each worker to know the person to whom they are directly responsible, helping avoid conflicting authority.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Be directly responsible to the head of the department, Cooperate with each other, Be rotated in different sections"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
('mc:the government agency is mandated to ensure the safety of food supplies.:::fda', 'the government agency is mandated to ensure the safety of food supplies.', 'FDA', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"FDA (Food and Drug Administration): This agency is primary mandated to ensure the safety, efficacy, and quality of food supplies, drugs, cosmetics, and medical devices.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"FDA\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"FDA (Food and Drug Administration): This agency is primary mandated to ensure the safety, efficacy, and quality of food supplies, drugs, cosmetics, and medical devices.\n\n• DA (Department of Agriculture): While the DA is heavily involved in agriculture and food production, the regulatory enforcement of safety standards for processed and pre-packaged food supplies falls under the FDA.\n• FNRI (Food and Nutrition Research Institute): Focuses on research, data collection, and nutritional science.\n• NNC (National Nutrition Council): Serves as the policy-making and coordinating body for nutrition programs.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: FNRI, NNC, DA"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
