('mc:menu analysis is essential in determining::::all of the above', 'menu analysis is essential in determining:', 'All of the above', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"Menu analysis helps determine equipment needs, kitchen space, and the number and skills of workers; therefore all listed factors may be affected.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"All of the above\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"Menu analysis helps determine equipment needs, kitchen space, and the number and skills of workers; therefore all listed factors may be affected.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Type and number of equipment, Kitchen space requirements, Skills and number of workers"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
