('mc:a vodka-based cocktail made with tomato juice, lemon juice, and hot pepper sauce is::::bloody mary', 'a vodka-based cocktail made with tomato juice, lemon juice, and hot pepper sauce is:', 'Bloody Mary', true, '{"sources":[{"url":"","title":"Krause and Mahan''s Food & the Nutrition Care Process"},{"url":"","title":"NDLE Board Licensure Reference Manual"}],"whyRight":"<img alt=\"Bloody Mary Recipe\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" width=\"201\">b. Bloody Mary<img alt=\"Manhattan\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" width=\"147\">A. Manhattan is a whiskey-based cocktail traditionally made with vermouth and bitters. <img alt=\"Gimlet\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" width=\"200\">C. A Gimlet is traditionally made with gin or vodka and lime cordial or lime juice, not tomato juice.<img alt=\"Black Russian\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" width=\"198\">D. A Black Russian is vodka and coffee liqueur.","modelUsed":"Gemini 2.5 Flash","isAiPowered":true,"keyDifference":"Key differentiator: \"Bloody Mary\" aligns strictly with standard dietetics criteria.","searchOverview":"Official NDLE Board Licensure Reference & Evidence Breakdown","authorRationale":"<img alt=\"Bloody Mary Recipe\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" width=\"201\">b. Bloody Mary<img alt=\"Manhattan\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" width=\"147\">A. Manhattan is a whiskey-based cocktail traditionally made with vermouth and bitters. <img alt=\"Gimlet\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" width=\"200\">C. A Gimlet is traditionally made with gin or vodka and lime cordial or lime juice, not tomato juice.<img alt=\"Black Russian\" src=\"data:image/jpeg;base64,\" width=\"198\">D. A Black Russian is vodka and coffee liqueur.","whyWrongChoices":"Alternative options: Manhattan, Gimlet, Black Russian"}'::jsonb, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, NULL, '"2026-11-04T11:21:38.282Z"'::jsonb),
